          "settings": {
            "box_content": "",
            "box_content_liquid": "STARTER PACKAGE: Refresh existing content: EDIT-ONLY ($3,500)\n<ul>\n<li>Perfect for: Brands with existing footage needing professional polish</li>\n<li>Includes: Professional editing, color grading, basic motion graphics</li>\n<li>Deliverables: 5 videos (15-30 seconds each)</li>\n<li>Production: No shooting (client provides all footage)</li>\n<li>Timeline: 2-week turnaround</li>\n</ul>\n\nGROWTH PACKAGE: Create new campaign assets: SHOOT + EDIT ($6,000)\n<ul>\n<li>Perfect for: Single-location campaigns needing fresh content</li>\n<li>Includes: Half-day shoot, 3 scripted videos, 3 motion graphic videos</li>\n<li>Deliverables: 6 videos total (15-30 seconds each)</li>\n<li>Production: 1 location, 1 actor, 1-2-person crew, basic equipment</li>\n<li>Timeline: 3-week turnaround</li>\n</ul>\nIMPACT PACKAGE: Multi-location brand storytelling: MULTI-LOCATION ($11,000)\n<ul>\n<li>Perfect for: Brands needing diverse content across multiple settings</li>\n<li>Includes: Full-day shoot, 4 scripted videos, 4 motion graphic videos</li>\n<li>Deliverables: 8 videos total (15-30 seconds each)</li>\n<li>Production: 3 locations, 3 actors, 3-5-person crew, premium equipment</li>\n<li>Timeline: 4-week turnaround</li>\n</ul>\nCUSTOM PACKAGE: LET’S CHAT\n<ul>\n<li>Perfect for: Complex projects with specific requirements</li>\n<li>Starting at: $12,000+ (based on scope)</li>\n<li>We’ll build a tailored solution for your unique project needs</li>\n</ul>"
